   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Algoritmos de aprendizaje no supervisado utilizados para agrupar activos o condiciones de mercado con características y perfiles de riesgo similares.",
     "doc_id": 59
    },
    {
     "texto": "Técnicas basadas en grafos signados que agrupan nodos buscando maximizar conexiones positivas intra-grupo y minimizar conexiones positivas entre distintos grupos.",
     "doc_id": 79
    },
    {
     "texto": "Técnica de machine learning (no supervisada) usada para agrupar puntos de datos en clusters basados en su similitud.",
     "doc_id": 132
    },
    {
     "texto": "Técnica de aprendizaje no supervisado que agrupa datos (acciones) en clusters según similitud, medida por una distancia. En este paper se usa como filtro inicial para seleccionar pares candidatos antes de tradear.",
     "doc_id": 217
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "In unsupervised learning, clustering algorithms are commonly used to group similar data points, which is especially useful in the financial industry for segmenting assets or market conditions.",
     "doc_id": 59
    },
    {
     "texto": "In particular, we use signed clustering algorithms that handle negative weights because the correlation matrix of residual returns we employ consists of both positive and negative entries",
     "doc_id": 79
    },
    {
     "texto": "Clustering is a machine learning technique that can be used to group data points into clusters based on their similarity.",
     "doc_id": 132
    },
    {
     "texto": "Clustering algorithms group data points into clusters based on similarity, with similarity determined by a distance metric, such as the traditional Euclidean distance, which serves as the algorithm's starting point.",
     "doc_id": 217
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
