     "doc_id": 27
    },
    {
     "texto": "Cantidad de acciones disponibles en cada cotización del book; la profundidad del mismo lado aumenta la agresividad de la orden, la del lado opuesto la reduce.",
     "doc_id": 52
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "These quantities represent the depth at the top of the book; we will refer to them as ‘market depth’",
     "doc_id": 27
    },
    {
     "texto": "The same market depth and other displayed depths are positively associated with the order aggressiveness.",
