   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Protocolo DEX donde los precios se fijan mediante un algoritmo determinista a lo largo de una curva matemática, exponiendo a los proveedores a impermanent loss.",
     "doc_id": 60
    },
    {
     "texto": "Smart contract que opera en DEXs eliminando la necesidad de market makers activos tradicionales. Funciona con algoritmos de pricing predeterminados que facilitan cotización automática y risk sharing, permitiendo que incluso inversores retail provean liquidez.",
     "doc_id": 329
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "The constant-product automated market maker, where two token reserves x and y satisfy x·y = k, prices trades deterministically along a curve rather than through order matching.",
     "doc_id": 60
    },
    {
     "texto": "Unlike CEXs that utilize traditional limit order books, most DEXs employ automated market makers (AMMs)—smart contracts that eliminate the need for active market makers.",
     "doc_id": 329
    }
   ],
