     "doc_id": 398
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "The noise trading (NT) measure, measured by the difference between the frequencies of lucky and unlucky numbers in stock prices directly captures noise trading activity and negatively predicts China's stock market returns.",
